Yes, yes, yes, ofcourse you are right about the credibility.  The fact
that Lojban is an open source meritocracy is what it has in common
with Linux and why you are correct.

Perhaps if I wrote original work in Lojban we would have something to
talk about.  I guess time will tell.

I don't think you understand what I said about the concepts and
grammar...you make my claim sound grandiouse when all I meant was that
I have read quite a bit of the beginner materials and so far I
understand it all.  Memorizing it will be a different matter, I am
sure...based on my experience with learning Hebrew.

Jared

